{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":63.650001525878906,"text":"The theater is cut into the slope just above the temple with 35 rows of stone seats and room for about 5,000 people. It was built in the 4th century BC and hosted the music and drama contests of the Pythian Games. It has something almost no other theater has. The theater is cut into the slope just above the temple with 35 rows of stone seats and room for about 5,000 people. It was built in the 4th century BC and hosted the music and drama contests of the Pythian Games. It has something almost no other theater has. Everybody wants the worst seats. Sitting on the back row, behind everyone, you look over the actors' heads at the whole sanctuary, the valley of olive trees, and far off, the sea. The ancients knew it and designed it that way on purpose. The stage was never the only thing the audience was looking at. Think about that for a moment. In a modern theater, the lights go down so you can see nothing but the actors. Here they did the exact opposite, and they did it on purpose.","words":[{"word":"The","start":0,"end":0.46000000834465027},{"word":"theater","start":0.46000000834465027,"end":0.7400000095367432},{"word":"is","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":1.059999942779541},{"word":"cut","start":1.059999942779541,"end":1.2799999713897705},{"word":"into","start":1.2799999713897705,"end":1.5800000429153442},{"word":"the","start":1.5800000429153442,"end":1.8600000143051147},{"word":"slope","start":1.8600000143051147,"end":2.119999885559082},{"word":"just","start":2.119999885559082,"end":2.619999885559082},{"word":"above","start":2.619999885559082,"end":2.8399999141693115},{"word":"the","start":2.8399999141693115,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"temple","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.259999990463257},{"word":"with","start":3.259999990463257,"end":3.9200000762939453},{"word":"35","start":3.9200000762939453,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"rows","start":4.619999885559082,"end":4.9400000572